": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"source_term": "dual", "target_term": "对偶"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "证明(1)。假设<MATH_0001>完全忠实（fully faithful）。我们将证明<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphism）。任取态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。由伴随性（adjointness），它对应于态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>。由<MATH_0005>的完全忠实性（fully faithfulness），它对应于唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>。因此可见，与<MATH_0007>后合成（post-composing）定义了双射（bijection）<MATH_0008>。从而<MATH_0009>是同构（isomorphism）。若存在函子（functors）间的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0010>，则<MATH_0011>完全忠实（fully faithful）。由引理<REF_0001>可见，<MATH_0012>完全忠实（fully faithful）。由上面的论证，这蕴含<MATH_0013>是同构（isomorphism）。因此，这<MATH_0014>个条件全都等价（equivalent）（而且这些条件也等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0015>完全忠实（fully faithful））。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n第(2)项与第(1)项对偶（dual）。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:e886d86b1fcf6ea23d0af2db8b7042ddcc05986a3d667500a3c35983a869f08b", "unit_id": "tag:07RB:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "函子的完全忠实性质；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"context": "单位及函子间的同构；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "证明中的任意态射及其对应；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "由伴随获得的态射对应；暂定译法。", "source_term": "adjointness", "target_term": "伴随性"}, {"context": "原文这一词形的完全忠实性；暂定译法。", "source_term": "fully faithfulness", "target_term": "完全忠实性"}, {"context": "在态射之后合成单位；暂定译法。", "source_term": "post-composing", "target_term": "后合成"}, {"context": "态射集之间的双射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"context